    "aRank": "Only some characters can reach A rank, and many A ranks allow a Paired Ending in the epilogue.",
    "sRank": "Eshmel can pick a Paired Ending at a maximum rating of 5, which unlocks an S-rank scene. IGN states that every character Eshmel can reach A rank with is assumed, but not confirmed, to be S-rank eligible."
